# THE HUSH'S RINGS (docs/HUSH.md H0): the crags' own stone circles, found by
# name (`near hush_ring`, HushSites) and never at a coordinate. The tour stands
# in the nearest one: hand-cut stones round the player from above, and over the
# shoulder. Later slices add what happens in them.
#   TOUR_FIXED_FPS=60 tools/tour.sh tours/hush.tour --seed=7 --hour=11 --weather=clear:0
place the_crags
coast calm
near hush_ring
wait 0.8
shot 01-in-a-crags-ring-from-above
tap shoulder
await shoulder 3
wait 0.8
shot 02-in-a-crags-ring-over-the-shoulder with shoulder
